<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam's August CPI down 0.4 percent from July.</title>
<headline>Vietnam's August CPI down 0.4 percent from July.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's General Statistics Office issued the following economic indicators on Monday:</p>
<p>VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICES</p>
<p>					     Aug 96  July 96   June 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change		-0.4     -0.7	-0.5</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		  +3.2     +3.9	+4.6</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=Dec 1995)	 102.2    102.6     103.3</p>
</text>
